  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, be a polynomial of degree <math><mn>3</mn></math>, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, has a critical point at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, has a critical point at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, has local minima at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Integrating both the side with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>Integrating both the side with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#10233;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#10233;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> and <math><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#39;</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;is a point of&nbsp;local minima.</p>"
  }
